      ],
      "source": "https://www.mtmemory.org/nodes/view/127854",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Logging operations in Kila shut down during the 1930s, ending the town’s lumber‑based economy.",
