      ],
      "source": "https://www.mtmemory.org/nodes/view/127854",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Kila sits along U.S. Route 2, just ten miles east of Kalispell, making it a quick drive into the Flathead Valley.",
